<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.000" end="00:00:04.400" style="s2">must not be left alive. Grab all the</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.000" end="00:00:05.600" style="s2">data and evacuate. Prime the explosives.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.400" end="00:00:07.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then silence me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.600" end="00:00:08.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Viper, we&#39;ve already planted a chip in</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.500" end="00:00:10.400" style="s2">your brain. I&#39;ve triggered the</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.800" end="00:00:13.200" style="s2">detonation and you&#39;ll be blown to ash in</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.400" end="00:00:13.200" style="s2">30 seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.600" end="00:00:18.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 seconds?</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.400" end="00:00:22.300" style="s2">That&#39;s more than enough time.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.700" end="00:00:22.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open fire. OPEN FIRE NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.000" end="00:00:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SURPRISE.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.400" end="00:00:32.700" style="s2">TOLD YOU, 30 seconds is more than</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.200" end="00:00:32.700" style="s2">enough.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.000" end="00:00:38.300" style="s2">Then all of you can rot in hell right</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.370" end="00:00:38.300" style="s2">[music] alongside me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.300" end="00:00:44.540" style="s2">Can you believe this ugly freak has the</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.000" end="00:00:45.195" style="s2">nerve to use the school bathroom?</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.540" end="00:00:47.215" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.195" end="00:00:47.215" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.800" end="00:00:52.500" style="s2">I&#39;ve been reborn.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.500" end="00:00:54.600" style="s2">Reborn into the body of an ugly bullied</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.500" end="00:00:57.000" style="s2">high schooler. Hurry up and get a bucket</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.600" end="00:00:57.000" style="s2">of water.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.800" end="00:01:02.800" style="s2">Got the water?</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.300" end="00:01:05.700" style="s2">I&#39;m not the weak girl who let everyone</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.800" end="00:01:05.700" style="s2">walk all over her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.600" end="00:01:14.000" style="s2">What do you think you&#39;re doing?</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.500" end="00:01:17.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try me again</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.000" end="00:01:17.300" style="s2">and you won&#39;t get off this easy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.800" end="00:01:22.000" style="s2">Fighting these brats is nothing but an</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.200" end="00:01:22.000" style="s2">insult to me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.460" end="00:01:28.480" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.800" end="00:01:42.000" style="s2">From now on, there&#39;s no Viper anymore,</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.100" end="00:01:43.300" style="s2">only Ravena.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.000" end="00:01:44.400" style="s2">This face actually has a pretty good</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.300" end="00:01:46.300" style="s2">base.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.400" end="00:01:47.600" style="s2">As for these pimples, they&#39;re nothing I</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.300" end="00:01:49.300" style="s2">can&#39;t fix.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.600" end="00:01:51.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this really the same Ravena who used</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.300" end="00:01:53.800" style="s2">to be all meek and quiet?</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.600" end="00:01:56.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop talking. That look she gave earlier</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.800" end="00:01:56.800" style="s2">was so scary.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.400" end="00:02:03.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This again? We eat boxed mac and cheesy</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.592" end="00:02:04.992" style="s2">single day. I&#39;m so sick of it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.292" end="00:02:07.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is my family.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.992" end="00:02:09.792" style="s2">A cowardly father, a biased mother,</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.692" end="00:02:13.292" style="s2">and siblings who can&#39;t stand each other.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.792" end="00:02:13.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravena, come on over and eat.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.592" end="00:02:19.592" style="s2">Senior year stressful. You mentioned</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.192" end="00:02:20.792" style="s2">wanting steak last time. I&#39;ll swing by</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.592" end="00:02:23.092" style="s2">Costco tomorrow and pick some up for</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.792" end="00:02:25.492" style="s2">you. Stress with a GPA like hers?</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.092" end="00:02:25.492" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.092" end="00:02:30.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joshua, Ravena, your sister. How can you</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.192" end="00:02:31.792" style="s2">talk to her like that?</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.392" end="00:02:34.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you yelling at my son? What did</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.792" end="00:02:34.892" style="s2">Joshua say that was wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.992" end="00:02:39.292" style="s2">I really don&#39;t know what goes on in your</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.192" end="00:02:40.692" style="s2">head. A 2.0 GPA, 900 on your SAT</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.292" end="00:02:42.092" style="s2">practice test, and you still have the</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.692" end="00:02:44.192" style="s2">nerve to go on dates? You should be</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.092" end="00:02:46.292" style="s2">ashamed. And you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.192" end="00:02:47.792" style="s2">How did I end up with a loser like you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.292" end="00:02:50.392" style="s2">Everyone else moved to the city long</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.792" end="00:02:51.892" style="s2">ago, and we&#39;re still stuck in this dump.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.392" end="00:02:53.592" style="s2">All these years, if you&#39;d been good for</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.892" end="00:02:55.092" style="s2">something and made MORE MONEY, SOPHIA&#39;S</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.592" end="00:02:57.192" style="s2">LEG WOULDN&#39;T be lame.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.092" end="00:02:59.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adventure and Izola explosion. You</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.192" end="00:03:00.692" style="s2">really don&#39;t care at all, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.192" end="00:03:04.092" style="s2">They are fighting because of you, and</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.692" end="00:03:04.092" style="s2">you&#39;re just sitting there watching TV.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.392" end="00:03:08.292" style="s2">What&#39;s with that look? Did I say</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.892" end="00:03:10.192" style="s2">something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.292" end="00:03:11.592" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with her? She used to just</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.192" end="00:03:14.092" style="s2">hunch over and stare at the floor. She</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.592" end="00:03:16.092" style="s2">never dared stare back at me like this.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.092" end="00:03:19.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare glare at YOUR BROTHER LIKE</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.092" end="00:03:19.892" style="s2">THAT? HAVE YOU LOST YOUR MIND?</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.992" end="00:03:27.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything else?</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.092" end="00:03:45.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just came out for a walk. Can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.492" end="00:03:46.992" style="s2">believe there&#39;s centella asiática</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.092" end="00:03:48.892" style="s2">growing here.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.992" end="00:03:50.692" style="s2">Everyone writes this off as a weed, but</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.892" end="00:03:53.492" style="s2">it&#39;s amazing for fading acne marks and</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.692" end="00:03:53.492" style="s2">healing skin.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.592" end="00:04:00.092" style="s2">You barely touched your food at dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.592" end="00:04:01.894" style="s2">You must be hungry. Here, take these.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.092" end="00:04:05.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve always been on my own. No one&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.894" end="00:04:05.394" style="s2">ever done anything like this for me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.294" end="00:04:14.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She used to just lock herself in her</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.994" end="00:04:16.594" style="s2">room right after school, never coming</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.294" end="00:04:20.094" style="s2">out except for chores.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.594" end="00:04:20.094" style="s2">This is so weird today.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.594" end="00:04:29.294" style="s2">That ratio has to be a perfect square.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.794" end="00:04:29.294" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.194" end="00:04:34.694" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.994" end="00:04:39.594" style="s2">It&#39;s a perfect square. That&#39;s one of the</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.894" end="00:04:42.194" style="s2">hardest IMAT problems. Few got full</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.594" end="00:04:43.794" style="s2">marks, but she solved it instantly.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.194" end="00:04:45.494" style="s2">How do you even know?</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.794" end="00:04:46.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. Anyone with half a brain could</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.494" end="00:04:48.294" style="s2">solve that.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.494" end="00:04:49.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you always got Cs or Ds in math</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.294" end="00:04:52.194" style="s2">before. Those problems they gave were a</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.994" end="00:04:54.094" style="s2">total waste of time and ink. You&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.194" end="00:04:55.094" style="s2">faking it this whole time?</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.094" end="00:04:58.194" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.094" end="00:04:58.194" style="s2">Then solve this one right now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.994" end="00:05:03.394" style="s2">This isn&#39;t a normal contest problem.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.094" end="00:05:04.894" style="s2">It&#39;s an open KT problem. Solving it gets</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.394" end="00:05:06.194" style="s2">you direct admission.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.894" end="00:05:08.994" style="s2">It&#39;s been up for over a year and</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.194" end="00:05:12.594" style="s2">nobody&#39;s cracked it yet.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.994" end="00:05:14.494" style="s2">Now this is actually interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.594" end="00:05:15.894" style="s2">What am I even hoping for?</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.494" end="00:05:18.694" style="s2">She must have seen that earlier problem</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.894" end="00:05:18.694" style="s2">somewhere before.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.694" end="00:05:29.094" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.494" end="00:05:32.094" style="s2">You actually solved that problem from</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.094" end="00:05:32.094" style="s2">the KT website?</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.494" end="00:05:39.494" style="s2">You solved it that fast?</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.394" end="00:05:41.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In this whole messed up family, this</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.494" end="00:05:43.394" style="s2">stepsister is the only one not</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.294" end="00:05:45.094" style="s2">completely unbearable.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.394" end="00:05:46.894" style="s2">The stupid sister I&#39;ve known for over a</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.094" end="00:05:48.494" style="s2">decade has been faking it this whole</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.894" end="00:05:49.694" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.494" end="00:05:52.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to look that shocked</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.694" end="00:05:52.294" style="s2">every time.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.494" end="00:05:56.294" style="s2">You&#39;re really making this hard to</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.694" end="00:05:56.294" style="s2">resist.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.894" end="00:06:10.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All those fancy beauty formulas don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.795" end="00:06:12.995" style="s2">work half as well as the stuff I mix up</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.595" end="00:06:15.095" style="s2">myself. All the acne on this face will</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.995" end="00:06:17.495" style="s2">be totally gone by tomorrow night, no</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.095" end="00:06:17.495" style="s2">doubt.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.795" end="00:06:23.095" style="s2">What time is it? Why isn&#39;t Raven known</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.495" end="00:06:24.395" style="s2">up making breakfast yet?</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.095" end="00:06:25.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard her banging in her room last</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.395" end="00:06:27.795" style="s2">night. Maybe she was practicing makeup.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.995" end="00:06:29.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That face, makeup won&#39;t help. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.795" end="00:06:30.095" style="s2">pimply looks like a toad stuck in shabby</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.495" end="00:06:31.395" style="s2">glasses.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.095" end="00:06:32.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aiden even avoids her and here she is</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.395" end="00:06:33.095" style="s2">trying to date like everyone else. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.495" end="00:06:34.595" style="s2">hilarious.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.095" end="00:06:36.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t say that about my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.595" end="00:06:37.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mind your own business. Hurry up and</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.095" end="00:06:39.495" style="s2">catch the school bus.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.695" end="00:06:40.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She she&#39;s actually really nice.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.495" end="00:06:44.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think she&#39;s nice? Are you blind or</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.895" end="00:06:44.495" style="s2">just stupid? Look at that ugly thing.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.895" end="00:06:49.795" style="s2">Ravona, what are you hiding for? Doing</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.295" end="00:06:50.895" style="s2">makeup? Aiden will never like you. See,</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.795" end="00:06:51.695" style="s2">she doesn&#39;t even have the guts to come</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.895" end="00:06:54.495" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.695" end="00:06:54.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Embarrassing.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.514" end="00:07:02.534" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.495" end="00:07:07.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that really the same ugly duckling?</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.195" end="00:07:08.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravona,</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.495" end="00:07:10.994" style="s2">how are your acne and dark spots</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.995" end="00:07:11.295" style="s2">completely gone?</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.994" end="00:07:13.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.295" end="00:07:14.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I grabbed some random ointment, left it</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.095" end="00:07:16.095" style="s2">on overnight and it was all cleared up</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.595" end="00:07:19.495" style="s2">by morning.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.095" end="00:07:19.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just some random ointment?</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.495" end="00:07:25.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which hand did you push her with just</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.795" end="00:07:25.095" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.295" end="00:07:27.995" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.295" end="00:07:29.995" style="s2">you</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.995" end="00:07:31.495" style="s2">If this ever happens again, I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.995" end="00:07:34.095" style="s2">sure you can&#39;t hold a thing for the rest</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.495" end="00:07:34.095" style="s2">of your life.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.850" end="00:07:41.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.695" end="00:07:43.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, the look in her eyes is so scary.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.695" end="00:07:47.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That little brat, why does she seem like</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.495" end="00:07:47.195" style="s2">a totally different person today?</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.495" end="00:07:52.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look really nice like this. This</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.895" end="00:07:54.195" style="s2">sister is actually pretty cute. What do</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.995" end="00:07:56.295" style="s2">you want for breakfast? I don&#39;t have any</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.195" end="00:07:58.195" style="s2">cash on me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.295" end="00:07:59.395" style="s2">Mom gave me $5 this morning. Let&#39;s grab</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.195" end="00:08:00.795" style="s2">a sandwich from the convenience store</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.395" end="00:08:02.495" style="s2">later or whatever you feel like. It&#39;s up</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.795" end="00:08:04.050" style="s2">to you. Guess I was never going to get a</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.495" end="00:08:04.495" style="s2">cut of that breakfast money anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.050" end="00:08:07.795" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.495" end="00:08:07.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go. A sandwich is fine.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.795" end="00:08:10.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.897" end="00:08:12.565" style="s2">&gt;&gt; high school campus? This feels totally</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.997" end="00:08:14.585" style="s2">foreign to me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.565" end="00:08:14.585" style="s2">[music]</p>
