<p begin="00:09:17.397" end="00:09:21.597" style="s2">Oh my god. Is that Ravena?</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.297" end="00:09:22.897" style="s2">How did she get this hot all of a</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.597" end="00:09:24.297" style="s2">sudden?</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.897" end="00:09:27.097" style="s2">I swear she used to wear those dorky</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.297" end="00:09:28.297" style="s2">black frames and have such messy hair.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.097" end="00:09:29.297" style="s2">I had no idea she looked this hot</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.297" end="00:09:31.597" style="s2">without her glasses.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.297" end="00:09:32.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if she got prettier?</p>
