<p begin="00:09:32.897" end="00:09:35.097" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.397" end="00:09:36.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. I bet she&#39;s just doing all this</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.097" end="00:09:37.797" style="s2">to get Aiden&#39;s attention.</p>
