<p begin="00:10:20.898" end="00:10:25.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry?</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.198" end="00:10:27.798" style="s2">What are you standing there gawking for?</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.398" end="00:10:27.798" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.098" end="00:10:33.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis,</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.298" end="00:10:36.398" style="s2">you</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.098" end="00:10:36.398" style="s2">you don&#39;t like Aiden anymore?</p>
