<p begin="00:10:49.198" end="00:10:53.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Judging by how things went today, the</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.198" end="00:10:55.298" style="s2">bullying Sophia usually puts up with at</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.198" end="00:10:57.898" style="s2">school can&#39;t be any less than what I</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.298" end="00:10:57.898" style="s2">went through.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.798" end="00:11:03.798" style="s2">Too bad. I&#39;ve got no money and no</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.998" end="00:11:07.298" style="s2">supplies either. Otherwise, fixing a leg</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.798" end="00:11:07.298" style="s2">injury would be child&#39;s play.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.198" end="00:11:12.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ava, the genius doctor, is the only</p>
