<p begin="00:11:18.898" end="00:11:21.698" style="s2">the same person.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.298" end="00:11:23.798" style="s2">I was planning to sneak into the lab to</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.698" end="00:11:24.798" style="s2">get her out, but I accidentally blew my</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.798" end="00:11:28.198" style="s2">cover</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.798" end="00:11:28.198" style="s2">and drew the hit squad right to me.</p>
