<p begin="00:11:51.698" end="00:11:54.398" style="s2">feet.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.398" end="00:11:56.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get lost if you don&#39;t want to die.</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.398" end="00:11:59.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can help you. The wound didn&#39;t hit any</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.498" end="00:12:00.898" style="s2">vitals. You won&#39;t die. Of course,</p>
