<p begin="00:13:09.284" end="00:13:11.304" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.799" end="00:13:15.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.399" end="00:13:23.399" style="s2">I knew you weren&#39;t dead.</p>
