<p begin="00:13:51.099" end="00:13:55.599" style="s2">you in time to back you up and you got</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.599" end="00:13:58.499" style="s2">hurt. I&#39;ll report for punishment later.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.599" end="00:13:58.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no need for that.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.099" end="00:14:02.899" style="s2">Uncle, is something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.499" end="00:14:05.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I owe my life to a young girl who</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.899" end="00:14:07.299" style="s2">stepped in yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.499" end="00:14:08.799" style="s2">Looks like she&#39;s still a student.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.299" end="00:14:11.299" style="s2">Transfer money to this card.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.799" end="00:14:11.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.499" end="00:14:16.201" style="s2">How much should I send? He said she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.399" end="00:14:19.501" style="s2">still a student. If I send too much, it</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.201" end="00:14:19.501" style="s2">might put her in an awkward pause.</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.701" end="00:14:28.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, isn&#39;t your student meal card out</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.201" end="00:14:29.501" style="s2">of money?</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.201" end="00:14:31.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I used to throw money around like it was</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.501" end="00:14:32.401" style="s2">nothing, and now I&#39;m getting by on cash</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.501" end="00:14:33.501" style="s2">from a kid.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.401" end="00:14:34.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;d you get this?</p>
