<p begin="00:14:34.901" end="00:14:36.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about you if you give all this to</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.001" end="00:14:38.901" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.501" end="00:14:40.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still have money on my card for meals.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.901" end="00:14:42.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you know I was out of money?</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.901" end="00:14:43.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You used to ask mom for money every</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.201" end="00:14:45.301" style="s2">week, but it&#39;s been over a week now and</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.901" end="00:14:47.101" style="s2">you haven&#39;t asked.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.301" end="00:14:48.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe having a sister isn&#39;t so bad.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.101" end="00:14:50.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry up. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.801" end="00:14:52.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got all the people lined up?</p>
