<p begin="00:14:55.401" end="00:15:01.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugly little freak. How dare she threaten</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.901" end="00:15:01.701" style="s2">me? She&#39;s dead meat.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.601" end="00:15:11.901" style="s2">If you don&#39;t make a move now, I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.801" end="00:15:11.901" style="s2">home before you know it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.201" end="00:15:22.101" style="s2">If you don&#39;t strike now, I&#39;ll be home.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.301" end="00:15:25.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blame yourself for pissing off the wrong</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.701" end="00:15:28.601" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.801" end="00:15:30.201" style="s2">Damn, you kind of hot.</p>
