<p begin="00:15:34.301" end="00:15:38.901" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.201" end="00:15:38.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll die.</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.901" end="00:15:50.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU&#39;RE LUCKY. IT&#39;S NOT THE TIME FOR ME</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.601" end="00:15:53.401" style="s2">TO DEAL WITH BODIES, so I&#39;ll let you</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.901" end="00:15:55.101" style="s2">keep your pathetic lives.</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.401" end="00:15:56.101" style="s2">Talk. Who sent you?</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.101" end="00:15:57.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.101" end="00:16:00.901" style="s2">It was a girl from your school.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.901" end="00:16:04.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sophia, you never learn, do you? I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.901" end="00:16:04.601" style="s2">mind finding some fun at your expense.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.401" end="00:16:13.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dude, I just saw Sophia getting cornered</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.201" end="00:16:14.801" style="s2">out front by the school gates. Her she</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.201" end="00:16:16.401" style="s2">hired guys to beat someone, but they got</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.801" end="00:16:17.902" style="s2">wrecked. Now they&#39;re making Sophia cover</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.401" end="00:16:19.002" style="s2">their hospital bills. Principal and</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.902" end="00:16:21.502" style="s2">teachers are already there. Come on,</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.002" end="00:16:21.502" style="s2">let&#39;s go see.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.402" end="00:16:34.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t go?</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.202" end="00:16:36.902" style="s2">Not interested.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.202" end="00:16:42.902" style="s2">It&#39;s not worth seeing. I&#39;ll show you</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.802" end="00:16:43.502" style="s2">something far more exciting later.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.902" end="00:16:45.802" style="s2">Eat up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.502" end="00:16:45.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.202" end="00:16:56.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, if it isn&#39;t the high and mighty</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.602" end="00:16:58.802" style="s2">Sophia. Look what a sad state you&#39;re in</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.602" end="00:17:00.102" style="s2">now. What&#39;s the hurry? You were tough</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.802" end="00:17:01.502" style="s2">before, cornering people in the bathroom</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.102" end="00:17:03.702" style="s2">with your gang like you owned it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.502" end="00:17:05.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Why cow now? Where are your pals?</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.702" end="00:17:07.602" style="s2">They transferred. Too scared to sink</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.202" end="00:17:07.602" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.702" end="00:17:12.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m paying you back for everything.</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.502" end="00:17:12.502" style="s2">You&#39;ll get what you deserve.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.601" end="00:17:15.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.302" end="00:17:25.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have any money.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.702" end="00:17:25.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hand it over. No money, my ass.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.402" end="00:17:32.902" style="s2">You book herds always say you have no</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.202" end="00:17:34.702" style="s2">cash. You only pay after getting beaten.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.902" end="00:17:38.102" style="s2">You dare fight me for it? This hunk of</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.702" end="00:17:38.102" style="s2">junk isn&#39;t worth jack</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.627" end="00:17:53.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.902" end="00:17:53.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run, sis. Get out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.557" end="00:17:56.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.212" end="00:17:56.232" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.902" end="00:18:00.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.402" end="00:18:00.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.107" end="00:18:02.302" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.902" end="00:18:03.702" style="s2">This is the second hand phone I bought</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.302" end="00:18:06.302" style="s2">with my part-time money. I need it for</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.702" end="00:18:08.302" style="s2">all my school work.</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.302" end="00:18:11.602" style="s2">Sis, those thugs Sophia sent were</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.302" end="00:18:13.102" style="s2">actually coming for you, weren&#39;t they?</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.602" end="00:18:15.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did run into them after school the</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.102" end="00:18:15.502" style="s2">other day.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.802" end="00:18:19.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then how did they get hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.502" end="00:18:21.502" style="s2">Did you do that to them?</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.302" end="00:18:21.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.602" end="00:18:26.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.103" end="00:18:26.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; tell them to cause trouble at school?</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.903" end="00:18:30.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was already merciful enough not to let</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.503" end="00:18:32.912" style="s2">them beat Sophia to a pulp.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.892" end="00:18:32.912" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.403" end="00:18:37.203" style="s2">Is this really the sister I&#39;ve known for</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.103" end="00:18:39.403" style="s2">more than a decade? She feels so</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.203" end="00:18:41.903" style="s2">different, but I really like this tough,</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.403" end="00:18:43.603" style="s2">capable side of her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.903" end="00:18:45.003" style="s2">A million dollars?</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.603" end="00:18:47.303" style="s2">The head of the Varelli family sure is</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.003" end="00:18:47.303" style="s2">cheap.</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.303" end="00:18:52.503" style="s2">Let&#39;s head home. I&#39;ll take you to buy a</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.703" end="00:18:52.503" style="s2">new phone tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.438" end="00:18:58.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.953" end="00:19:06.973" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.193" end="00:19:12.213" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.803" end="00:19:20.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, where did you get all this money?</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.303" end="00:19:21.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Earned it fair and square. No stealing,</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.003" end="00:19:23.103" style="s2">no robbing.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.003" end="00:19:24.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But this is way too much, isn&#39;t it? I</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.103" end="00:19:26.703" style="s2">know how hard you work for money. You</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.403" end="00:19:26.703" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.503" end="00:19:31.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, making money is pretty easy</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.303" end="00:19:31.703" style="s2">for me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.303" end="00:19:35.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.903" end="00:19:38.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You better get used to it. This is how</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.703" end="00:19:38.903" style="s2">life&#39;s going to be from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.903" end="00:19:45.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, great news. You got accepted to</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.103" end="00:19:45.903" style="s2">KIT.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.503" end="00:19:55.203" style="s2">Sis, great news.</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.603" end="00:19:56.503" style="s2">Look, KIT sent you an offer.</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.203" end="00:19:58.603" style="s2">I posted your problem-solving</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.503" end="00:20:00.003" style="s2">walkthrough on KIT&#39;s math forum. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.603" end="00:20:01.703" style="s2">why they reached out.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.003" end="00:20:04.203" style="s2">The professors there are really eager to</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.703" end="00:20:04.203" style="s2">meet you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.503" end="00:20:13.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not really interested in this.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.003" end="00:20:13.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? It&#39;s KIT.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.903" end="00:20:18.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have time for research. I&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.703" end="00:20:21.003" style="s2">too much of my own stuff to handle.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.603" end="00:20:24.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So will you apply to KIT then?</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.003" end="00:20:26.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KIT? Sure. ICA is right in that area. I</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.605" end="00:20:28.305" style="s2">can&#39;t wait to be reunited with my dear</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.305" end="00:20:30.905" style="s2">organization. Whatever you decide, I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.305" end="00:20:30.905" style="s2">got your back.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.305" end="00:20:38.305" style="s2">What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.605" end="00:20:40.405" style="s2">I&#39;m installing tracking systems on my</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.305" end="00:20:41.905" style="s2">phone and laptop and setting up</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.405" end="00:20:44.405" style="s2">firewalls.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.905" end="00:20:48.205" style="s2">I&#39;m ICA&#39;s top assassin and the hacker</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.405" end="00:20:48.205" style="s2">king who haunts corrupt elites.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.905" end="00:20:57.405" style="s2">Interested?</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.205" end="00:21:00.705" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.405" end="00:21:00.705" style="s2">I&#39;ll teach you if you want to learn.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.889" end="00:21:03.509" style="s2">[clears throat] Really?</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.205" end="00:21:05.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.509" end="00:21:05.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.505" end="00:21:18.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready to detonate.</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.609" end="00:21:18.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.705" end="00:21:24.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can all rot in hell with me!</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.105" end="00:21:29.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugly freak, OPEN THE DOOR. OPEN UP RIGHT</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.305" end="00:21:31.205" style="s2">NOW. [screaming] HIDING IN THERE WON&#39;T</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.605" end="00:21:32.805" style="s2">SAVE YOU. OPEN THIS DOOR BEFORE I BEAT</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.205" end="00:21:34.305" style="s2">THE CRAP OUT OF YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.805" end="00:21:36.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU THIEF. WHERE DID YOU GET THIS MONEY?</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.305" end="00:21:37.905" style="s2">WHO DID YOU STEAL FROM? CONFESS OR I&#39;LL</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.105" end="00:21:39.805" style="s2">BEAT YOU BADLY.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.905" end="00:21:40.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOLD ON, don&#39;t do that. Sophia told me</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.805" end="00:21:44.105" style="s2">she didn&#39;t steal that money. Just hear</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.905" end="00:21:44.105" style="s2">the kid out first, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.405" end="00:21:47.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t steal it? You expect me to</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.505" end="00:21:49.305" style="s2">believe someone just gave her all that</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.805" end="00:21:51.805" style="s2">stuff for free?</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.305" end="00:21:53.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, these stuff costs tens of thousands</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.805" end="00:21:54.505" style="s2">of dollars easy.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.605" end="00:21:56.505" style="s2">You think that doesn&#39;t count as a</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.505" end="00:21:59.905" style="s2">felony?</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.505" end="00:21:59.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t steal any money.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.005" end="00:22:02.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she didn&#39;t steal it, where did it</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.905" end="00:22:03.705" style="s2">come from?</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.505" end="00:22:06.505" style="s2">You think someone like her could go out</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.705" end="00:22:06.505" style="s2">and sell herself for it?</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.705" end="00:22:11.405" style="s2">Watch your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.305" end="00:22:11.405" style="s2">THAT&#39;S YOUR SISTER.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.905" end="00:22:19.905" style="s2">You bought a Death Top too?</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.305" end="00:22:22.605" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how you talk your way out of</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.905" end="00:22:22.605" style="s2">this one.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.405" end="00:22:30.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOM, HELP ME.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.106" end="00:22:32.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT DO YOU THINK YOU&#39;RE DOING? Let go</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.906" end="00:22:34.555" style="s2">of Joshua.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.006" end="00:22:36.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, SHE&#39;S GOING TO BREAK MY ARM.</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.555" end="00:22:37.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.106" end="00:22:39.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LOOK AT THIS. THIS IS YOUR PRECIOUS</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.606" end="00:22:40.906" style="s2">DAUGHTER.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.206" end="00:22:43.906" style="s2">If she dares to push us today, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.906" end="00:22:43.906" style="s2">hit you tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.506" end="00:22:53.806" style="s2">I&#39;ve put up with you two this long</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.606" end="00:22:55.906" style="s2">only for Dad and Sophia.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.806" end="00:22:58.606" style="s2">Don&#39;t test my patience again.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.906" end="00:23:00.906" style="s2">From now on, when you see me,</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.606" end="00:23:02.906" style="s2">keep your mouth shut.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.906" end="00:23:05.006" style="s2">Otherwise, I won&#39;t hesitate to shut you</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.906" end="00:23:08.306" style="s2">up myself.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.006" end="00:23:08.306" style="s2">And that goes for you too, Joshua.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.906" end="00:23:12.106" style="s2">Since you&#39;re so dying to know where I</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.206" end="00:23:13.856" style="s2">got all that money, go ahead and call</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.106" end="00:23:14.506" style="s2">the cops then.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.856" end="00:23:16.406" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.506" end="00:23:18.906" style="s2">But I&#39;m warning you now,</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.406" end="00:23:21.606" style="s2">if it turns out I&#39;ve done nothing wrong,</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.906" end="00:23:24.306" style="s2">I will press full defamation charges</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.606" end="00:23:24.306" style="s2">against you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.906" end="00:23:31.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You see that? How dare she talk to us</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.506" end="00:23:31.106" style="s2">like that?</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.606" end="00:23:36.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me say this one more time.</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.106" end="00:23:38.506" style="s2">She didn&#39;t steal that money.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.906" end="00:23:40.806" style="s2">And she didn&#39;t do anything shameful to</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.506" end="00:23:44.106" style="s2">get it either. She earned it</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.806" end="00:23:44.106" style="s2">writing code for websites.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.906" end="00:23:50.206" style="s2">I know she doesn&#39;t need my defense,</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.506" end="00:23:52.006" style="s2">but I can&#39;t stand the slander.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.206" end="00:23:54.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As if a loser like Raven Nana could</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.006" end="00:23:58.106" style="s2">write code and earn that much money.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.606" end="00:24:00.806" style="s2">Total lie. She&#39;s just messing with us.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.106" end="00:24:02.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.806" end="00:24:04.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister isn&#39;t stupid.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.906" end="00:24:05.406" style="s2">She didn&#39;t do bad in school before</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.106" end="00:24:07.406" style="s2">because she couldn&#39;t. She just didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.406" end="00:24:08.706" style="s2">bother trying.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.406" end="00:24:10.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t bother?</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.706" end="00:24:10.906" style="s2">Only an idiot like you would buy that</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.206" end="00:24:12.706" style="s2">crap.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.906" end="00:24:15.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She solved that math problem posted on</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.706" end="00:24:16.806" style="s2">the KIT math forum. If you don&#39;t believe</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.106" end="00:24:18.906" style="s2">me, go check the KIT math forum</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.806" end="00:24:22.006" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.906" end="00:24:22.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you rambling about?</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.606" end="00:24:33.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luca, I invited you for today&#39;s lecture,</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.807" end="00:24:35.707" style="s2">but I need a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.107" end="00:24:35.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead, professor.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.307" end="00:24:42.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need you to help me find someone.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.207" end="00:24:44.408" style="s2">Someone solved our forum&#39;s world-class</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.107" end="00:24:45.408" style="s2">problem days ago. We can&#39;t reach them.</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.408" end="00:24:48.107" style="s2">Look,</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.408" end="00:24:48.107" style="s2">this is the person.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.007" end="00:24:53.307" style="s2">Nice handwriting. This approach is</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.908" end="00:24:55.607" style="s2">actually pretty brilliant.</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.307" end="00:24:57.908" style="s2">Nolan, track the IP</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.607" end="00:24:57.908" style="s2">on it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.107" end="00:25:01.307" style="s2">How long is this going to take?</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.242" end="00:25:08.007" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.507" end="00:25:09.408" style="s2">3 minutes tops. Relax. Nolan is Q,</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.007" end="00:25:11.507" style="s2">ranked 10th among the world&#39;s top</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.408" end="00:25:13.908" style="s2">hackers. Tracing an IP is child&#39;s play</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.507" end="00:25:13.908" style="s2">for him.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.408" end="00:25:19.207" style="s2">What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.607" end="00:25:19.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Their device has a firewall in place.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.107" end="00:25:28.707" style="s2">In Marvella.</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.807" end="00:25:28.707" style="s2">Narrow it down further.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.807" end="00:25:34.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.307" end="00:25:38.007" style="s2">Now this is interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.107" end="00:25:38.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this? What&#39;s wrong with my phone?</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.408" end="00:25:42.607" style="s2">It&#39;s been hacked.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.908" end="00:25:42.607" style="s2">Who did this?</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.707" end="00:25:46.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll know soon enough.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.908" end="00:25:48.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I set up the firewall for Sophia out of</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.807" end="00:25:52.307" style="s2">boredom and habit.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.408" end="00:25:52.307" style="s2">Didn&#39;t expect it to be useful so soon.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.007" end="00:25:57.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve spotted me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.207" end="00:26:02.507" style="s2">They didn&#39;t just reinforce their</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.207" end="00:26:02.507" style="s2">firewall. They broke through mine.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.908" end="00:26:07.408" style="s2">And they&#39;re backtracking my device right</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.207" end="00:26:07.408" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.507" end="00:26:11.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This location is almost certainly</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.007" end="00:26:12.408" style="s2">connected to Kaito.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.007" end="00:26:15.307" style="s2">That problem,</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.408" end="00:26:15.307" style="s2">they&#39;re looking for you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.507" end="00:26:18.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In that case, let&#39;s send them a little</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.107" end="00:26:22.207" style="s2">greeting back.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.807" end="00:26:23.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A greeting? What kind?</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.207" end="00:26:25.307" style="s2">How do you even send something back to</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.607" end="00:26:27.908" style="s2">them?</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.307" end="00:26:27.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My turn.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.207" end="00:26:32.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re much better than before. Looks</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.107" end="00:26:35.409" style="s2">like someone else has taken over.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.209" end="00:26:35.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see how you handle this.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.709" end="00:26:39.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I made my name young.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.509" end="00:26:41.209" style="s2">This is the first time I&#39;ve ever been</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.809" end="00:26:42.409" style="s2">outplayed.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.209" end="00:26:43.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here?</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.409" end="00:26:46.109" style="s2">I remember that girl lives in this</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.609" end="00:26:49.209" style="s2">neighborhood, too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.109" end="00:26:49.209" style="s2">What a coincidence.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.283" end="00:26:55.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.409" end="00:27:01.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That birth mark.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.809" end="00:27:04.309" style="s2">Not bad.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.209" end="00:27:04.309" style="s2">Kind of hot, actually.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.909" end="00:27:09.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It has to be someone near the top of the</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.109" end="00:27:11.409" style="s2">leaderboard. Do you recognize who it is?</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.709" end="00:27:13.609" style="s2">Judging by the technique, looks like</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.409" end="00:27:15.109" style="s2">King, the number one ranked.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.609" end="00:27:17.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t believe I&#39;m going up against my</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.109" end="00:27:19.709" style="s2">idol. This is so unreal.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.509" end="00:27:22.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s definitely his MO. He made a post</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.709" end="00:27:24.009" style="s2">online just to solve a math problem.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.309" end="00:27:25.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kind of want to meet this person. A</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.009" end="00:27:27.909" style="s2">genius hacker, this unpredictable,</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.909" end="00:27:30.209" style="s2">impossible to pin down.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.909" end="00:27:31.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you found them yet? Professor, stop</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.209" end="00:27:32.609" style="s2">looking.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.409" end="00:27:34.709" style="s2">None of the offers you&#39;re making are</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.609" end="00:27:36.509" style="s2">things this person needs.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.709" end="00:27:39.209" style="s2">He solved that math problem just showing</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.509" end="00:27:39.209" style="s2">off his skills.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.309" end="00:27:44.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.009" end="00:27:46.339" style="s2">Someone that talented doesn&#39;t need</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.309" end="00:27:47.309" style="s2">anything I&#39;m offering.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.339" end="00:27:50.109" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.309" end="00:27:52.609" style="s2">I was being too small-minded.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.109" end="00:27:54.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your phone&#39;s fixed. Get some rest early.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.609" end="00:27:56.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.809" end="00:28:00.809" style="s2">I didn&#39;t expect one post to turn into</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.609" end="00:28:00.809" style="s2">this mess. I have to delete it now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.404" end="00:28:04.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.509" end="00:28:07.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the latest development plan for</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.009" end="00:28:07.109" style="s2">the Sand Verio Resort.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.409" end="00:28:16.209" style="s2">What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.809" end="00:28:16.209" style="s2">What the</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.509" end="00:28:22.364" style="s2">No need to guess. This is definitely</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.309" end="00:28:23.409" style="s2">someone&#39;s little payback.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.364" end="00:28:26.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.409" end="00:28:26.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It won&#39;t shut off, Mr. Varelli.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.009" end="00:28:30.709" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay for it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.189" end="00:28:34.410" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.809" end="00:28:37.110" style="s2">My laptop got a virus. I swear I never</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.410" end="00:28:37.110" style="s2">saved that stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.910" end="00:28:40.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meeting adjourned.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.910" end="00:28:46.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reilly.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.710" end="00:28:48.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan, that was brutal. I&#39;ve never seen</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.310" end="00:28:49.910" style="s2">my uncle look that pissed off.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.310" end="00:28:51.510" style="s2">That was perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.910" end="00:28:54.510" style="s2">Our market share is up this year,</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.510" end="00:28:56.010" style="s2">especially in our alcove.</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.510" end="00:28:57.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Varelli,</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.010" end="00:28:59.410" style="s2">Dario&#39;s condition has worsened.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.810" end="00:29:01.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Contact the neurosurgery specialist</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.410" end="00:29:02.510" style="s2">immediately, Dr. Reed. I&#39;m heading back</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.510" end="00:29:03.910" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.510" end="00:29:05.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong, Uncle Luca?</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.910" end="00:29:08.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad&#39;s taken a turn for the worse. We</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.610" end="00:29:08.610" style="s2">need to get back right now.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.910" end="00:29:12.410" style="s2">Why did you delete the forum post? Is</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.610" end="00:29:14.310" style="s2">Ravenna really planning to go to KIT?</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.410" end="00:29:16.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She doesn&#39;t need that. She said she can</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.310" end="00:29:18.910" style="s2">get into KIT on her own.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.810" end="00:29:22.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They are getting more and more alike.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.910" end="00:29:22.610" style="s2">Both of you are so annoying.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.110" end="00:29:27.410" style="s2">It&#39;s actually a AIT offer. Ravenna</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.410" end="00:29:28.910" style="s2">turned down something this good?</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.410" end="00:29:31.910" style="s2">She never told anyone that Ravenna</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.910" end="00:29:33.110" style="s2">solved those problems.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.910" end="00:29:35.710" style="s2">The principal doesn&#39;t even know who</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.110" end="00:29:35.710" style="s2">solved them.</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.910" end="00:29:39.410" style="s2">This is it. As long as I have this</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.910" end="00:29:41.010" style="s2">notebook, I&#39;ll be the genius who solved</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.410" end="00:29:45.110" style="s2">those problems.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.010" end="00:29:45.110" style="s2">That KIT offer will be mine.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.310" end="00:29:48.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you know I have the specific</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.910" end="00:29:50.110" style="s2">medication here?</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.710" end="00:29:51.610" style="s2">You sound like you&#39;re still just a</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.110" end="00:29:54.610" style="s2">teenage girl.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.610" end="00:29:57.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A friend referred me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.610" end="00:29:59.110" style="s2">I can&#39;t talk about that right now.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.310" end="00:30:00.610" style="s2">I&#39;ll wire you the deposit shortly, and</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.110" end="00:30:01.810" style="s2">I&#39;ll head to Colter City tomorrow to</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.610" end="00:30:03.110" style="s2">pick it up.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.810" end="00:30:05.310" style="s2">We&#39;ll see if I feel like answering your</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.110" end="00:30:06.610" style="s2">questions then.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.310" end="00:30:09.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.610" end="00:30:09.910" style="s2">I look forward to our meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.310" end="00:30:19.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis,</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.510" end="00:30:22.010" style="s2">Mom excused Joshua for a wedding today.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.810" end="00:30:23.910" style="s2">Are you going too?</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.010" end="00:30:26.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m heading to Colter City to pick</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.910" end="00:30:26.510" style="s2">something up.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.810" end="00:30:39.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis,</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.010" end="00:30:42.112" style="s2">what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.312" end="00:30:43.912" style="s2">Let me look at your leg.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.112" end="00:30:47.912" style="s2">She knows perfectly well this is the</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.912" end="00:30:47.912" style="s2">scar I never want anyone to see.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.912" end="00:31:00.412" style="s2">Is it really ugly?</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.812" end="00:31:02.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The muscle atrophy isn&#39;t severe.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.412" end="00:31:05.112" style="s2">It&#39;s treatable.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.412" end="00:31:05.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.212" end="00:31:08.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I can fix it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.912" end="00:31:10.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you just say?</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.412" end="00:31:12.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I can cure you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.612" end="00:31:13.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the doctor said</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.012" end="00:31:15.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.412" end="00:31:16.312" style="s2">Do you trust me?</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.012" end="00:31:17.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.312" end="00:31:20.526" style="s2">I don&#39;t know if I&#39;ll ever walk like</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.612" end="00:31:22.546" style="s2">everyone else, but I trust you, Ravenna.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.526" end="00:31:22.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.912" end="00:31:29.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We still can&#39;t identify the cause of Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.012" end="00:31:30.312" style="s2">Varelli&#39;s condition.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.012" end="00:31:31.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can there be no answers? What are we</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.312" end="00:31:32.812" style="s2">supposed to do now? Doctor Reed, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.412" end="00:31:34.712" style="s2">the best neurosurgeon in the field.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.812" end="00:31:38.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doctor Ava&#39;s neurosurgical skills are</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.712" end="00:31:39.912" style="s2">beyond unparalleled. If we can find her,</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.012" end="00:31:41.712" style="s2">there might still be a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.912" end="00:31:42.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doctor Ava is already</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.712" end="00:31:45.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dead.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.612" end="00:31:46.612" style="s2">What is it? What are you trying to say?</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.112" end="00:31:49.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right now, the only thing I can do is</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.612" end="00:31:51.312" style="s2">try to ease his pain. This illness is so</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.312" end="00:31:53.712" style="s2">bizarre. We can&#39;t even did point the</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.312" end="00:31:54.612" style="s2">cause.</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.712" end="00:31:56.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doctor Reed?</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.612" end="00:31:58.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must be Miss Moretti.</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.612" end="00:32:00.012" style="s2">The person who called me?</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.212" end="00:32:03.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.012" end="00:32:04.912" style="s2">I&#39;m here to pick up the formula.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.312" end="00:32:07.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you the formula was in my</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.912" end="00:32:09.112" style="s2">possession?</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.112" end="00:32:10.412" style="s2">Who told you I had the vials?</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.112" end="00:32:11.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ava sent me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.412" end="00:32:12.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ava?</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.512" end="00:32:14.112" style="s2">How is she?</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.712" end="00:32:15.912" style="s2">I haven&#39;t been able to reach her since</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.112" end="00:32:17.512" style="s2">we got separated in the war zone.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.912" end="00:32:19.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need to worry. She&#39;s doing</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.512" end="00:32:21.812" style="s2">very well now.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.012" end="00:32:21.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank goodness.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.212" end="00:32:28.612" style="s2">The vials here are what you came for.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.712" end="00:32:31.512" style="s2">Ava left them years ago,</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.612" end="00:32:31.512" style="s2">and I&#39;ve never touched them.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.412" end="00:32:39.313" style="s2">Miss Moretti,</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.712" end="00:32:41.413" style="s2">there&#39;s one more thing I need to ask.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.313" end="00:32:44.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dr. Reed, Mr. Verelli&#39;s heart rate is</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.413" end="00:32:44.513" style="s2">crashing. It&#39;s critical.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.913" end="00:32:49.113" style="s2">His heart rate still dropping.</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.113" end="00:32:56.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heart rate&#39;s in free fall. His blood</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.813" end="00:32:56.813" style="s2">pressure can&#39;t hold.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.413" end="00:33:08.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s heart failure. We don&#39;t have much</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.313" end="00:33:08.413" style="s2">time before it&#39;s too late.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.613" end="00:33:12.613" style="s2">I can save him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.113" end="00:33:12.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.513" end="00:33:19.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can save him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.913" end="00:33:21.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.513" end="00:33:24.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I need Dr. Reed to assist. Everyone</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.613" end="00:33:27.813" style="s2">else, get out now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.113" end="00:33:27.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Who even is this?</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.613" end="00:33:31.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.113" end="00:33:33.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never thought the head of the Verelli</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.413" end="00:33:36.613" style="s2">family would be such a skilled hacker.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.813" end="00:33:38.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Raven Anna, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.613" end="00:33:40.698" style="s2">Oh, I get it. You&#39;re putting on this act</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.413" end="00:33:40.913" style="s2">just to get close to me, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.698" end="00:33:43.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.913" end="00:33:45.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Outrageous. We won&#39;t hold this against a</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.313" end="00:33:47.713" style="s2">naive young girl, but you need to leave</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.113" end="00:33:47.713" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.313" end="00:33:52.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are the odds?</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.613" end="00:33:56.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 100%</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.113" end="00:33:57.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Out.</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.713" end="00:33:59.913" style="s2">Everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.913" end="00:34:01.313" style="s2">Miss Moretti, I&#39;m counting on you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.913" end="00:34:02.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t expect him to trust me this</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.313" end="00:34:05.113" style="s2">easily.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.113" end="00:34:05.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I hear you correctly?</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.313" end="00:34:13.513" style="s2">What&#39;s your plan?</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.213" end="00:34:14.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IV push. This dose will stabilize him</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.513" end="00:34:17.713" style="s2">and buy us time.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.813" end="00:34:17.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;ll get everything ready.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.613" end="00:34:23.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Luca, you can&#39;t let her fool you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.313" end="00:34:24.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said she treats him.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.013" end="00:34:26.313" style="s2">If anything goes wrong, I take full</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.613" end="00:34:27.713" style="s2">responsibility.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.313" end="00:34:30.213" style="s2">Anyone who has more to say can get out</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.713" end="00:34:32.813" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.213" end="00:34:32.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.993" end="00:34:41.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.513" end="00:34:48.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The dark Mr. Varelli coughed up was</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.314" end="00:34:48.214" style="s2">built up toxins.</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.214" end="00:34:55.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravenna, thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.414" end="00:34:55.914" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry for everything I said earlier.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.214" end="00:35:00.314" style="s2">I know you have a crush on me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.914" end="00:35:02.814" style="s2">To pay you back, I&#39;ll let you be my</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.314" end="00:35:02.814" style="s2">girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.514" end="00:35:08.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s really no need for that.</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.214" end="00:35:10.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I always repay my debts or, you know, I</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.714" end="00:35:13.054" style="s2">could just be your boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.814" end="00:35:13.914" style="s2">Aiden.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.054" end="00:35:15.914" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.914" end="00:35:17.514" style="s2">Ms. Moretti, wait a moment. I&#39;d like a</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.914" end="00:35:19.814" style="s2">word with you in private.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.514" end="00:35:21.614" style="s2">You saved my father, Ms. Moretti.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.814" end="00:35:22.814" style="s2">If you ever need anything in the future,</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.614" end="00:35:24.114" style="s2">just say it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.814" end="00:35:26.314" style="s2">We will move heaven and earth to help</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.114" end="00:35:26.314" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.914" end="00:35:31.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are certainly being generous this</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.714" end="00:35:33.714" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.514" end="00:35:35.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What makes you say that, Ms. Moretti?</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.714" end="00:35:37.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all, last time you only paid me $1</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.914" end="00:35:39.614" style="s2">million.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.414" end="00:35:41.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time I sent Aiden to handle it. I</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.614" end="00:35:43.514" style="s2">had no idea he&#39;d be so careless. That</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.914" end="00:35:46.314" style="s2">was my oversight.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.514" end="00:35:48.614" style="s2">So I&#39;ll hand it personally this time.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.314" end="00:35:51.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll gladly take it. Hit me up next</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.614" end="00:35:53.014" style="s2">time you&#39;ve got a gig this good.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.214" end="00:35:54.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Though I had assumed that only Dr. Ava</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.014" end="00:35:55.714" style="s2">could save my father,</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.514" end="00:35:56.814" style="s2">I didn&#39;t expect you would pull it off</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.714" end="00:35:58.314" style="s2">too, Ms. Moretti.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.814" end="00:35:59.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dr. Ava?</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.314" end="00:36:01.414" style="s2">Do I not look the part?</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.714" end="00:36:03.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the Dr. Ava I&#39;ve looked into has</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.414" end="00:36:05.914" style="s2">another identity.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.314" end="00:36:09.114" style="s2">Dr. Ava isn&#39;t just a doctor. She&#39;s also</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.914" end="00:36:10.714" style="s2">the ICA&#39;s top assassin, Viper.</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.114" end="00:36:12.914" style="s2">But a few months ago, Viper failed a</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.714" end="00:36:13.970" style="s2">mission and was lost at sea, presumed</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.914" end="00:36:15.990" style="s2">dead.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.970" end="00:36:15.990" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.114" end="00:36:21.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A doctor, a killer,</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.214" end="00:36:21.714" style="s2">saving lives while ending them.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.814" end="00:36:25.514" style="s2">This guy&#39;s kind of interesting. Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.814" end="00:36:26.914" style="s2">the information Mr. Varelli looked into</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.514" end="00:36:29.414" style="s2">is incorrect. They are not the same</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.914" end="00:36:29.414" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.690" end="00:36:31.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.814" end="00:36:36.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.814" end="00:36:39.514" style="s2">Maybe Dr. Ava isn&#39;t 22 either. She&#39;s 18.</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.714" end="00:36:42.414" style="s2">Maybe Viper never actually died.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.514" end="00:36:44.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Moretti, you&#39;re still here? Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.414" end="00:36:47.316" style="s2">There&#39;s something I&#39;d like to ask you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.516" end="00:36:47.316" style="s2">You two talk first.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.316" end="00:36:52.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luca, we found her.</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.416" end="00:36:53.816" style="s2">I found the person we&#39;ve been looking</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.716" end="00:36:55.816" style="s2">for.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.816" end="00:36:57.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations. I&#39;m curious, was the</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.816" end="00:36:59.216" style="s2">person a man or a woman?</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.316" end="00:37:01.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a boy.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.216" end="00:37:02.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone knows X is a girl. I guess X</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.516" end="00:37:05.516" style="s2">just happened to take that hit for him</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.916" end="00:37:05.516" style="s2">by chance.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.816" end="00:37:13.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s my sketchbook? I swear it was</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.716" end="00:37:14.516" style="s2">right here. How could it be gone?</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.016" end="00:37:17.116" style="s2">Sis, you&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.516" end="00:37:17.116" style="s2">What&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.216" end="00:37:22.016" style="s2">Wait, this is a specialized therapeutic</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.716" end="00:37:23.716" style="s2">agent. After injection, your nerve and</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.016" end="00:37:26.816" style="s2">muscle repair will progress much faster</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.716" end="00:37:29.016" style="s2">than normal. Then my leg?</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.816" end="00:37:30.516" style="s2">Can my leg actually be fully healed? Of</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.016" end="00:37:32.316" style="s2">course.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.516" end="00:37:34.536" style="s2">But we have to follow the full course.</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.316" end="00:37:36.556" style="s2">Today we&#39;ll start with half the dose.</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.536" end="00:37:36.556" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.816" end="00:37:40.416" style="s2">You mean right now?</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.916" end="00:37:40.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right now.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.916" end="00:37:46.216" style="s2">Take a deep breath. It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.916" end="00:37:55.516" style="s2">Okay, open up.</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.616" end="00:38:00.316" style="s2">So sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.771" end="00:38:02.916" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.316" end="00:38:04.516" style="s2">Sis, it feels kind of warm right here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.916" end="00:38:07.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s normal. It means the medicine is</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.516" end="00:38:09.251" style="s2">working. Try moving your ankle a little.</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.116" end="00:38:12.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think my leg is getting stronger.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.251" end="00:38:13.816" style="s2">[laughter] Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.216" end="00:38:15.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re good.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.816" end="00:38:17.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s been days now. Why aren&#39;t mom and</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.516" end="00:38:19.316" style="s2">Joshua back yet?</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.616" end="00:38:22.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This trip was totally worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.316" end="00:38:23.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The big city&#39;s so much better.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.216" end="00:38:24.716" style="s2">Um where did I put that shirt?</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.716" end="00:38:27.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s in that cabinet, the one on the</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.716" end="00:38:27.216" style="s2">second shelf.</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.716" end="00:38:29.516" style="s2">Sis, I don&#39;t think mom and the others</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.716" end="00:38:30.516" style="s2">were actually at a wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.516" end="00:38:31.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever they went off to do, it&#39;s none</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.516" end="00:38:32.916" style="s2">of my business.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.416" end="00:38:34.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But something just feels off. Ravena&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.916" end="00:38:36.016" style="s2">already done so much for me. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.716" end="00:38:37.416" style="s2">keep bothering her with every little</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.016" end="00:38:39.516" style="s2">thing.</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.416" end="00:38:40.416" style="s2">It&#39;s okay. This is exactly how she did</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.516" end="00:38:41.616" style="s2">it yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.416" end="00:38:43.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sophia, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.616" end="00:38:43.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, this is the medicine Ravena got me</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.516" end="00:38:45.216" style="s2">for my leg.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.916" end="00:38:46.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you really going to inject yourself</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.216" end="00:38:48.317" style="s2">with some random stuff from who knows</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.517" end="00:38:50.317" style="s2">where? Have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.317" end="00:38:52.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, this is the medicine Ravenna got</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.317" end="00:38:54.317" style="s2">for me. I took half a dose yesterday. My</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.517" end="00:38:57.217" style="s2">leg really is getting better.</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.317" end="00:38:57.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Better? How could one shot make anything</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.217" end="00:38:59.517" style="s2">better?</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.717" end="00:39:00.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.517" end="00:39:03.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on here?</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.917" end="00:39:04.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at your daughter, sticking needles</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.117" end="00:39:06.817" style="s2">right into her own leg.</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.917" end="00:39:08.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is medicine Ravenna got specially</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.817" end="00:39:08.917" style="s2">for her. Give it back to the kid right</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.417" end="00:39:11.117" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.917" end="00:39:13.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it back my ass. This kind of</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.117" end="00:39:15.117" style="s2">garbage is a hazard keeping it around.</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.217" end="00:39:18.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, give that back to me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.117" end="00:39:18.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calm down first.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.337" end="00:39:22.667" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.647" end="00:39:22.667" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.517" end="00:39:28.517" style="s2">You&#39;ve got some nerves showing up here.</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.517" end="00:39:29.517" style="s2">Look at all this stuff you&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.517" end="00:39:31.117" style="s2">giving Sophia.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.517" end="00:39:32.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.117" end="00:39:35.417" style="s2">Do you trust me?</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.917" end="00:39:35.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.717" end="00:39:39.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sophia, are you out of your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.017" end="00:39:42.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you don&#39;t believe me, watch</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.317" end="00:39:42.017" style="s2">carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.917" end="00:39:46.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.717" end="00:39:49.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, you&#39;re actually doing this? Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.517" end="00:39:49.517" style="s2">kill her WITH THAT THING.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.917" end="00:39:57.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALL DONE.</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.617" end="00:39:58.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MY LEG.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.017" end="00:40:00.657" style="s2">I CAN FEEL MY LEG.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.637" end="00:40:00.657" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.117" end="00:40:08.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stand up.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.717" end="00:40:08.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you stand?</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.917" end="00:40:11.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take two steps.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.617" end="00:40:18.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can walk. Dad, I can walk.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.317" end="00:40:22.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.917" end="00:40:24.517" style="s2">Her leg has been lame for over a decade.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.417" end="00:40:26.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing in this world is impossible. You</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.517" end="00:40:27.217" style="s2">just haven&#39;t seen it yet.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.217" end="00:40:28.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.217" end="00:40:30.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t cry.</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.617" end="00:40:31.917" style="s2">From now on, you&#39;ll have all the time in</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.317" end="00:40:34.817" style="s2">the world to walk,</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.917" end="00:40:34.817" style="s2">step [snorts] by step.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.248" end="00:40:41.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.018" end="00:41:02.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here you go.</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.518" end="00:41:04.518" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.618" end="00:41:06.218" style="s2">These are for you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.518" end="00:41:08.218" style="s2">Why are you giving me flowers? To</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.218" end="00:41:09.918" style="s2">celebrate. Everyone else gets flowers</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.218" end="00:41:11.318" style="s2">after their tests, too.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.918" end="00:41:12.918" style="s2">Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.318" end="00:41:15.018" style="s2">I think this is actually the first time</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.918" end="00:41:17.118" style="s2">someone&#39;s ever gotten me flowers.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.018" end="00:41:18.918" style="s2">Your leg isn&#39;t bothering you, right?</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.118" end="00:41:21.918" style="s2">Not at all. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.918" end="00:41:21.918" style="s2">Come on then, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.018" end="00:41:30.718" style="s2">Raven Arata, I knew you&#39;d make it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.518" end="00:41:33.318" style="s2">Perfect SAT and ACT. KIT would be nuts</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.718" end="00:41:35.918" style="s2">to turn you down. It&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.318" end="00:41:37.818" style="s2">Dude, you are way too calm about this.</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.918" end="00:41:41.118" style="s2">Honestly, I knew you&#39;d make it. You were</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.818" end="00:41:41.118" style="s2">worried I wouldn&#39;t get in, remember?</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.218" end="00:41:46.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if she got a perfect score? I</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.918" end="00:41:47.218" style="s2">can get into KIT, too.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.218" end="00:41:48.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk your voice down.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.218" end="00:41:51.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I might not get a perfect score, but I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.918" end="00:41:54.918" style="s2">more than good enough to get into KIT.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.818" end="00:41:58.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat your apple and shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.918" end="00:41:58.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something feels off about this.</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.718" end="00:42:05.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Check in is up the stairs, left side.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.918" end="00:42:07.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I finally get to have a brand new</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.418" end="00:42:07.818" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.418" end="00:42:12.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, wait up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.318" end="00:42:13.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Chloe, right?</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.018" end="00:42:14.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, the Vashti Group heiress.</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.418" end="00:42:16.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s even prettier in person than in</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.618" end="00:42:17.318" style="s2">photos.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.018" end="00:42:18.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, did you hear? There&#39;s an incoming</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.318" end="00:42:20.618" style="s2">freshman who got perfect scores on both</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.818" end="00:42:21.218" style="s2">the SAT and ACT. I think her name&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.618" end="00:42:22.618" style="s2">Ravenna.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.218" end="00:42:24.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s insane.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.618" end="00:42:26.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Classic KIT. Of course there&#39;s a genius</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.718" end="00:42:28.918" style="s2">like that here.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.018" end="00:42:28.918" style="s2">Just another bookworm.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.418" end="00:42:37.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you blind?</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.818" end="00:42:38.718" style="s2">You walked into me first.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.118" end="00:42:40.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s with your attitude? Do you have</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.718" end="00:42:42.918" style="s2">any idea who this is?</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.618" end="00:42:44.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Freshman?</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.918" end="00:42:46.218" style="s2">When you&#39;re checking in as a freshman,</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.218" end="00:42:49.418" style="s2">learn to watch your step. Clumsy people</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.218" end="00:42:51.918" style="s2">don&#39;t last long at KIT.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.418" end="00:42:55.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you done?</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.918" end="00:42:55.720" style="s2">Then move. You&#39;re blocking the path.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.720" end="00:43:01.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, aren&#39;t you interesting? What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.720" end="00:43:01.220" style="s2">your name?</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.279" end="00:43:09.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.320" end="00:43:17.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the Verelli family&#39;s car.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.120" end="00:43:20.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holy crap. I&#39;ve never seen anything like</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.920" end="00:43:21.620" style="s2">this in person.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.020" end="00:43:23.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wonder who he&#39;s here for.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.620" end="00:43:25.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Verelli is obviously here for our</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.520" end="00:43:27.720" style="s2">Chloe. Duh.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.620" end="00:43:28.920" style="s2">Some people can grind all they want.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.720" end="00:43:30.920" style="s2">They&#39;ll still be stuck at the bottom</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.920" end="00:43:32.825" style="s2">looking up.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.920" end="00:43:34.520" style="s2">Better luck in your next life, hick.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.825" end="00:43:36.920" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.520" end="00:43:38.520" style="s2">Aiden.</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.920" end="00:43:39.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravenna.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.520" end="00:43:40.920" style="s2">What took you so long? I&#39;ve been waiting</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.720" end="00:43:42.520" style="s2">here forever.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.920" end="00:43:44.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aiden&#39;s straight up ignoring Chloe for</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.520" end="00:43:46.020" style="s2">that new girl?</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.220" end="00:43:49.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, I figured if you wouldn&#39;t marry</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.020" end="00:43:49.820" style="s2">me, I&#39;d just marry you instead.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.220" end="00:43:54.220" style="s2">But my uncle shot that idea down.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.320" end="00:43:56.720" style="s2">But hey, it&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.220" end="00:43:59.420" style="s2">Even if I can&#39;t marry you yet,</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.720" end="00:44:01.320" style="s2">I can be your personal sidekick instead.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.420" end="00:44:03.820" style="s2">I&#39;m at KIT now, too. I&#39;ll be there</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.320" end="00:44:05.920" style="s2">whenever you call. No exceptions.</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.820" end="00:44:07.020" style="s2">Ravenna, are you thirsty? I&#39;ve got water</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.920" end="00:44:08.420" style="s2">in the car.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.020" end="00:44:09.420" style="s2">You must be tired, right? Let me give</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.420" end="00:44:10.820" style="s2">you a shoulder rub.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.420" end="00:44:12.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.820" end="00:44:13.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, okay.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.420" end="00:44:16.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like you two aren&#39;t all that</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.520" end="00:44:16.520" style="s2">impressive after all.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.720" end="00:44:22.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravenna, you haven&#39;t heard the last of</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.120" end="00:44:24.820" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.920" end="00:44:28.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it for today. Submit your</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.820" end="00:44:28.320" style="s2">homework to the system by Friday.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.220" end="00:44:40.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at what a sad sack you are.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.635" end="00:44:41.920" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.220" end="00:44:44.720" style="s2">And you your sister ran off fast today.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.920" end="00:44:44.720" style="s2">Lucky for her.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.720" end="00:44:50.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravenna, help me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.151" end="00:44:50.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.735" end="00:44:55.121" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.220" end="00:44:58.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course the two of you are related,</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.121" end="00:44:58.321" style="s2">both equally pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.321" end="00:45:11.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, look at this hick from the</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.221" end="00:45:14.321" style="s2">sticks. [laughter] I actually thought</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.321" end="00:45:16.221" style="s2">your sister was somebody.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.321" end="00:45:19.221" style="s2">If she hadn&#39;t run off today, I would</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.221" end="00:45:19.221" style="s2">have messed her up, too.</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.621" end="00:45:22.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Teach her a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.901" end="00:45:22.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.521" end="00:45:37.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hit him harder. That&#39;s what happens when</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.521" end="00:45:38.721" style="s2">you mess with Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.621" end="00:45:40.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis,</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.721" end="00:45:42.516" style="s2">why didn&#39;t you stick up for me?</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.721" end="00:45:43.421" style="s2">I&#39;m your own brother.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.516" end="00:45:46.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.421" end="00:45:47.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And why exactly should I help you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.021" end="00:45:49.521" style="s2">All those years you spent picking on me,</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.921" end="00:45:52.121" style="s2">remember?</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.521" end="00:45:53.121" style="s2">Need me to refresh your memory?</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.121" end="00:45:54.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.121" end="00:45:57.421" style="s2">The math department gave me a problem,</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.721" end="00:45:59.221" style="s2">but I have no clue how to solve it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.421" end="00:46:00.621" style="s2">I need her to solve it for me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.221" end="00:46:02.921" style="s2">Otherwise, everyone&#39;s going to find out</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.621" end="00:46:04.221" style="s2">I&#39;m a fraud sooner or later. Sis, I know</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.921" end="00:46:07.521" style="s2">I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.221" end="00:46:07.521" style="s2">We&#39;re real siblings, aren&#39;t we?</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.121" end="00:46:11.121" style="s2">Can you please forgive me?</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.321" end="00:46:14.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t call me sister.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.121" end="00:46:16.021" style="s2">Sophia is the only sister I have.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.321" end="00:46:18.721" style="s2">And if you ever get any more stupid</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.021" end="00:46:21.821" style="s2">ideas, you&#39;d better watch out.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.721" end="00:46:21.821" style="s2">I&#39;ll snap your neck.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.021" end="00:46:35.521" style="s2">Your brother broke this a few days ago.</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.421" end="00:46:37.521" style="s2">You can pay for it for him.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.521" end="00:46:39.521" style="s2">It&#39;s not even expensive, only $6</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.521" end="00:46:41.021" style="s2">million.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.521" end="00:46:43.521" style="s2">If you don&#39;t pay up, your little brother</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.021" end="00:46:44.821" style="s2">can kiss any peace in his life goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.521" end="00:46:47.021" style="s2">You could beat him to death for all I</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.821" end="00:46:49.321" style="s2">care. In fact, you&#39;d better make sure</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.021" end="00:46:51.421" style="s2">you do.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.321" end="00:46:53.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, Chloe&#39;s family has insane levels</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.421" end="00:46:54.921" style="s2">of power. Ravana is never going to have</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.321" end="00:46:56.721" style="s2">an easy time around here after this.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.921" end="00:46:58.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I how fast you ran earlier. Thought</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.721" end="00:47:00.023" style="s2">you were just a coward.</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.622" end="00:47:01.622" style="s2">Now that I see you&#39;ve got way more nerve</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.023" end="00:47:03.622" style="s2">than your brother, who can only beg for</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.622" end="00:47:05.622" style="s2">mercy.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.622" end="00:47:07.023" style="s2">You&#39;re a hick from nowhere. I know you</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.622" end="00:47:08.523" style="s2">couldn&#39;t afford this bracelet even if</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.023" end="00:47:10.523" style="s2">you sold your house.</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.523" end="00:47:12.723" style="s2">I&#39;m in a good mood today. Just give me a</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.523" end="00:47:15.823" style="s2">proper apology on behalf of your brother</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.723" end="00:47:15.823" style="s2">and I&#39;ll let you off the hook.</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.023" end="00:47:18.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could hear you yapping like a dog</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.323" end="00:47:21.323" style="s2">halfway across campus.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.823" end="00:47:23.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aiden, this is between her and me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.323" end="00:47:24.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it&#39;s Ravena&#39;s business, it&#39;s my</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.122" end="00:47:25.523" style="s2">business.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.023" end="00:47:27.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aiden, don&#39;t think I&#39;m scared of you</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.523" end="00:47:30.223" style="s2">just because your last name is Varelli.</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.523" end="00:47:33.223" style="s2">Haven&#39;t you heard I&#39;m engaged to Luca?</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.223" end="00:47:34.922" style="s2">Watch your mouth or I&#39;ll tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.223" end="00:47:36.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you just say?</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.922" end="00:47:38.723" style="s2">Luca?</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.023" end="00:47:41.723" style="s2">Engaged to you?</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.723" end="00:47:44.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you call him by his first name?</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.723" end="00:47:46.823" style="s2">But I guess you aren&#39;t totally clueless.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.523" end="00:47:49.223" style="s2">At least you know who Luca is.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.823" end="00:47:51.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luca is actually engaged to Chloe, the</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.223" end="00:47:53.823" style="s2">Visconti family&#39;s daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.323" end="00:47:55.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has the best luck ever.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.823" end="00:47:59.323" style="s2">I&#39;d be grinning from ear to ear in my</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.823" end="00:47:59.323" style="s2">sleep if that were me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.413" end="00:48:02.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.523" end="00:48:03.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My uncle never agreed to that.</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.523" end="00:48:06.422" style="s2">You&#39;re running around spreading</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.723" end="00:48:08.422" style="s2">nonsense.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.422" end="00:48:09.893" style="s2">If my uncle finds out about this, what</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.422" end="00:48:10.422" style="s2">do you think will happen to you?</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.893" end="00:48:11.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.422" end="00:48:13.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.122" end="00:48:16.122" style="s2">you you</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.823" end="00:48:17.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.122" end="00:48:19.622" style="s2">And don&#39;t ever show your face around</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.622" end="00:48:21.683" style="s2">Ravena again. Got it?</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.622" end="00:48:22.323" style="s2">I&#39;m saying this for your own good.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.683" end="00:48:24.823" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.323" end="00:48:27.122" style="s2">Ravena, where are you heading?</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.823" end="00:48:29.723" style="s2">I&#39;ll walk you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.122" end="00:48:32.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravena, Aiden,</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.723" end="00:48:32.922" style="s2">you two just wait.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.323" end="00:48:41.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sophia, working on your homework? Joshua</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.023" end="00:48:43.823" style="s2">just called. He&#39;s stuck on a problem.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.523" end="00:48:46.122" style="s2">I know Ravena can nail it. If he gets</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.823" end="00:48:49.422" style="s2">this right, the professor will notice</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.122" end="00:48:51.922" style="s2">him and a scholarship on the line.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.422" end="00:48:53.223" style="s2">Could you just help your brother out?</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.922" end="00:48:54.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.223" end="00:48:57.023" style="s2">I&#39;ll ask Ravena about it.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.922" end="00:48:59.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my girl. You really are my good</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.023" end="00:48:59.523" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.624" end="00:49:14.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joshua, don&#39;t worry. As long as Sophia</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.724" end="00:49:16.824" style="s2">asks Ravena for help, she&#39;ll do it for</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.624" end="00:49:18.424" style="s2">you. From now on, whenever they give you</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.824" end="00:49:19.324" style="s2">tough problems, I&#39;ll handle them for</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.424" end="00:49:21.124" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.324" end="00:49:22.824" style="s2">Oh, right. They didn&#39;t suspect anything,</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.124" end="00:49:24.624" style="s2">did they? Who told Joshua he could</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.824" end="00:49:26.124" style="s2">submit that problem as his own?</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.624" end="00:49:26.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jesus Christ, you scared me half to</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.124" end="00:49:28.924" style="s2">death.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.724" end="00:49:30.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it. Joshua stole Ravena&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.924" end="00:49:31.924" style="s2">solution, and you took it straight to</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.424" end="00:49:35.124" style="s2">Kai Ti.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.924" end="00:49:35.124" style="s2">You lied to them, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.699" end="00:49:38.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.724" end="00:49:40.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sophia,</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.424" end="00:49:42.524" style="s2">that&#39;s not how it is.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.524" end="00:49:45.124" style="s2">Listen to me. None of those things are</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.524" end="00:49:46.924" style="s2">what you think.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.124" end="00:49:48.924" style="s2">I&#39;m going to tell Ravena.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.924" end="00:49:50.424" style="s2">Sophia, give me that phone.</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.924" end="00:49:53.724" style="s2">Give it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.424" end="00:49:53.724" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch my phone.</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.924" end="00:49:57.824" style="s2">Get in there.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.524" end="00:50:00.724" style="s2">Get in.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.824" end="00:50:00.724" style="s2">Get in there now.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.524" end="00:50:06.024" style="s2">Sophia, you cannot make that call.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.724" end="00:50:07.624" style="s2">If you make that call, your brother</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.024" end="00:50:10.324" style="s2">whole life is over.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.624" end="00:50:12.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, let me out. Let me out.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.324" end="00:50:13.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sophia,</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.224" end="00:50:16.724" style="s2">I&#39;ll let you out when you promise you</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.524" end="00:50:16.724" style="s2">won&#39;t say anything to Ravena.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.524" end="00:50:25.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sophia,</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.224" end="00:50:27.124" style="s2">your mom told me what happened with your</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.524" end="00:50:29.324" style="s2">brother.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.124" end="00:50:30.924" style="s2">They did the wrong thing this time.</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.324" end="00:50:32.524" style="s2">But your mom&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.924" end="00:50:35.024" style="s2">If this gets out, your brother&#39;s life is</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.524" end="00:50:35.024" style="s2">ruined.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.124" end="00:50:40.824" style="s2">To Ravena, it&#39;s just a trivial problem</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.724" end="00:50:44.424" style="s2">she doesn&#39;t even bother wasting time on.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.824" end="00:50:47.324" style="s2">But this is Joshua&#39;s entire future.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.424" end="00:50:49.124" style="s2">It&#39;s all because I&#39;m useless.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.324" end="00:50:51.624" style="s2">I never managed to give you kids a good</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.124" end="00:50:51.624" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.024" end="00:50:55.624" style="s2">And I failed to raise your brother</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.424" end="00:50:58.230" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.624" end="00:50:59.524" style="s2">Most of all, I let your sister down.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.230" end="00:51:00.850" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.524" end="00:51:02.870" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.850" end="00:51:02.870" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.020" end="00:51:12.040" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.915" end="00:51:19.245" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.225" end="00:51:19.245" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.525" end="00:51:28.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom told me Sophia already found out I</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.325" end="00:51:30.425" style="s2">stole Ravenna&#39;s spot and faked my way</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.925" end="00:51:33.625" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.425" end="00:51:33.625" style="s2">She won&#39;t tell Ravenna, right?</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.925" end="00:51:40.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sophia said you&#39;ve got a problem you</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.425" end="00:51:40.325" style="s2">need me to solve.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.425" end="00:51:48.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could she possibly know that? Did</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.725" end="00:51:49.825" style="s2">Sophia tell her?</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.225" end="00:51:52.125" style="s2">No, that can&#39;t be. If she knew the</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.825" end="00:51:53.725" style="s2">truth, she wouldn&#39;t be this calm.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.125" end="00:51:56.925" style="s2">Sis.</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.725" end="00:51:56.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you so nervous about?</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.725" end="00:52:01.525" style="s2">I heard the scholarship is huge.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.925" end="00:52:03.825" style="s2">If I solve this problem, the whole prize</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.525" end="00:52:05.225" style="s2">is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.825" end="00:52:06.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All yours.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.225" end="00:52:08.125" style="s2">As long as you help me solve this</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.425" end="00:52:10.425" style="s2">problem, I&#39;ll give you anything you</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.125" end="00:52:10.425" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.525" end="00:52:14.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the problem?</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.625" end="00:52:14.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, here it is.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.925" end="00:52:22.025" style="s2">Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.225" end="00:52:25.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve memorized the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.725" end="00:52:35.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That fast?</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.125" end="00:52:36.325" style="s2">Sis, you&#39;re insane at this.</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.225" end="00:52:37.325" style="s2">If I run into problems I don&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.325" end="00:52:38.925" style="s2">later,</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.325" end="00:52:40.625" style="s2">can I come ask you again? Once I turn</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.925" end="00:52:42.125" style="s2">this problem into the professor, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.625" end="00:52:44.025" style="s2">give you all the scholarship money. I</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.125" end="00:52:46.225" style="s2">promise. Thanks, sis.</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.025" end="00:52:48.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Ravenna. Fancy running into you</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.225" end="00:52:50.425" style="s2">here. Congratulations on taking home the</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.625" end="00:52:52.025" style="s2">gold at the last competition.</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.425" end="00:52:53.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, President Preston.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.025" end="00:52:54.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have time now? I&#39;d like to</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.525" end="00:52:56.325" style="s2">introduce you to a couple of new</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.825" end="00:52:57.825" style="s2">acquaintances.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.325" end="00:53:00.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What new acquaintances?</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.825" end="00:53:02.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An incredibly sharp young man, just as</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.125" end="00:53:04.025" style="s2">talented as you are. In fact, he just</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.525" end="00:53:05.127" style="s2">helped the professors crack another</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.025" end="00:53:07.027" style="s2">tough math problem.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.127" end="00:53:09.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A math genius, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.027" end="00:53:11.027" style="s2">Color me curious.</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.927" end="00:53:14.327" style="s2">Well,</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.027" end="00:53:14.327" style="s2">now you&#39;ve got my attention.</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.627" end="00:53:20.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Funny you should say that.</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.027" end="00:53:22.027" style="s2">He&#39;s from the same hometown as you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.427" end="00:53:23.827" style="s2">It&#39;s been ages since the math department</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.027" end="00:53:26.727" style="s2">was this lively.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.827" end="00:53:26.727" style="s2">Let&#39;s head over right away.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.927" end="00:53:35.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you&#39;re all here already? My</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.327" end="00:53:36.927" style="s2">apologies for keeping you waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.427" end="00:53:39.327" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.927" end="00:53:40.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excellent. The younger generation truly</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.327" end="00:53:42.227" style="s2">is impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.827" end="00:53:44.127" style="s2">I wonder if Joshua would consider</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.227" end="00:53:46.327" style="s2">applying for my PhD program. If he</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.127" end="00:53:47.427" style="s2">applies anywhere, it&#39;ll be my PhD</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.327" end="00:53:50.927" style="s2">program. All right, this should</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.427" end="00:53:50.927" style="s2">ultimately be Joshua&#39;s decision.</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.927" end="00:53:56.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is she doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.927" end="00:53:57.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we help you?</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.127" end="00:53:59.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The president told me there&#39;s a math</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.527" end="00:54:00.627" style="s2">genius from my hometown. I thought I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.327" end="00:54:03.127" style="s2">come by to see what all the fuss is</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.627" end="00:54:03.127" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.527" end="00:54:07.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;m not mistaken, you won the gold</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.727" end="00:54:10.327" style="s2">medal at the latest International</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.327" end="00:54:12.527" style="s2">Mathematics Competition.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.327" end="00:54:14.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.527" end="00:54:16.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This must be Ravenna, right?</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.527" end="00:54:19.972" style="s2">I heard you got perfect scores on both</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.327" end="00:54:21.927" style="s2">the SAT and ACT.</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.972" end="00:54:24.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.927" end="00:54:28.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. It&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.827" end="00:54:30.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. President, may I take a look?</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.427" end="00:54:30.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here you go.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.127" end="00:54:35.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I spent forever copying her handwriting,</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.027" end="00:54:38.827" style="s2">and I still can only nail about 70% of</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.027" end="00:54:38.827" style="s2">it. I&#39;m totally busted now.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.327" end="00:54:42.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like we don&#39;t just come from the</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.627" end="00:54:46.127" style="s2">same town.</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.627" end="00:54:46.127" style="s2">We even have the same handwriting.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.627" end="00:54:57.627" style="s2">A freshman solving this complex math?</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.327" end="00:54:57.627" style="s2">That&#39;s seriously impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.627" end="00:55:03.827" style="s2">Hang on. What did Joshua get on his SAT?</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.127" end="00:55:05.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He didn&#39;t take the SAT or the SAT. He</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.827" end="00:55:07.327" style="s2">got in through special admission.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.327" end="00:55:09.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Special admission?</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.327" end="00:55:11.328" style="s2">As his sister, how did I not know about</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.028" end="00:55:11.328" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.128" end="00:55:20.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.428" end="00:55:20.228" style="s2">are siblings?</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.528" end="00:55:26.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, she&#39;s my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.628" end="00:55:26.128" style="s2">We&#39;re twins.</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.028" end="00:55:30.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why were you offered a special admission</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.528" end="00:55:32.328" style="s2">spot?</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.928" end="00:55:33.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, it&#39;s because he solved the</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.328" end="00:55:35.528" style="s2">math problem that stumped the field for</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.928" end="00:55:38.028" style="s2">27 years.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.528" end="00:55:39.528" style="s2">Joshua, no need to be so modest.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.028" end="00:55:42.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Modest, right?</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.528" end="00:55:42.728" style="s2">You never even mentioned it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.128" end="00:55:47.728" style="s2">I&#39;m actually interested in math.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.028" end="00:55:50.328" style="s2">I was wondering if Joshua here could</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.728" end="00:55:53.928" style="s2">walk us through</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.328" end="00:55:53.928" style="s2">your approach to solving the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.228" end="00:56:03.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not feeling too great today. Sis,</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.128" end="00:56:05.028" style="s2">next time, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.028" end="00:56:08.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it that you&#39;re not feeling well</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.028" end="00:56:08.328" style="s2">or that you don&#39;t know how to do it?</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.428" end="00:56:13.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Joshua,</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.728" end="00:56:14.728" style="s2">what&#39;s going on? You were doing</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.328" end="00:56:16.428" style="s2">perfectly fine a second ago, weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.728" end="00:56:19.228" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.428" end="00:56:19.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh nothing. I</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.128" end="00:56:35.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravenna, what on earth are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.128" end="00:56:39.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.928" end="00:56:43.128" style="s2">So my name should be on it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.728" end="00:56:48.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.628" end="00:56:56.028" style="s2">Did you solve this problem?</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.028" end="00:57:08.428" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.529" end="00:57:21.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait a second.</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.229" end="00:57:23.329" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this the problem from the forum?</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.629" end="00:57:24.729" style="s2">I asked Joshua many times for those</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.329" end="00:57:27.429" style="s2">detailed solution steps, but he never</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.729" end="00:57:27.429" style="s2">gave them to me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.029" end="00:57:33.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you copy someone else&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.329" end="00:57:33.029" style="s2">handwriting,</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.229" end="00:57:37.729" style="s2">you still have to use your brain, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.729" end="00:57:40.629" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.729" end="00:57:43.829" style="s2">Handwriting can be copied,</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.629" end="00:57:43.829" style="s2">but intelligence can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.329" end="00:57:59.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She knew I stole the exam questions.</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.829" end="00:58:01.829" style="s2">Why did she walk me through solving it?</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.129" end="00:58:01.829" style="s2">I&#39;ve been set up.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.829" end="00:58:07.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know the old saying about the mantis</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.329" end="00:58:09.829" style="s2">stalking the cicada,</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.429" end="00:58:12.529" style="s2">oblivious to the oriole lurking right</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.829" end="00:58:12.529" style="s2">behind?</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.529" end="00:58:19.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it&#39;s you who solved that problem</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.629" end="00:58:21.429" style="s2">posted on the forum?</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.829" end="00:58:23.429" style="s2">Then</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.429" end="00:58:24.829" style="s2">what about this one?</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.429" end="00:58:26.429" style="s2">No wonder</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.829" end="00:58:29.429" style="s2">you insisted on keeping the special</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.429" end="00:58:30.829" style="s2">admissions offer completely confidential</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.429" end="00:58:33.729" style="s2">because you never worked those problems</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.829" end="00:58:35.429" style="s2">at all. You stole the exam papers.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.729" end="00:58:37.629" style="s2">That explains why every time I reached</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.429" end="00:58:39.229" style="s2">out to discuss the problems with you,</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.629" end="00:58:41.629" style="s2">you always had some excuse to brush me</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.229" end="00:58:42.929" style="s2">off. You never solved a single one of</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.629" end="00:58:44.929" style="s2">those problems.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.929" end="00:58:48.529" style="s2">You have some nerve pulling an</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.929" end="00:58:48.529" style="s2">impersonation scheme like this.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.429" end="00:58:54.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Ravinana.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.929" end="00:58:54.529" style="s2">I messed up really bad.</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.929" end="00:58:58.029" style="s2">I regretted it the second I did it,</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.329" end="00:59:01.229" style="s2">Ravinana. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.029" end="00:59:02.829" style="s2">I can&#39;t get expelled. I can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.229" end="00:59:05.029" style="s2">What am I supposed to do if I get kicked</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.829" end="00:59:05.029" style="s2">out?</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.229" end="00:59:08.329" style="s2">Please, Ravinana, forgive me. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.029" end="00:59:09.529" style="s2">begging you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.329" end="00:59:10.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravinana, what do you want to do about</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.529" end="00:59:12.431" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.529" end="00:59:13.531" style="s2">After all, he&#39;s your brother.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.431" end="00:59:14.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravena,</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.531" end="00:59:14.831" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.725" end="00:59:16.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.831" end="00:59:18.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We share nothing but blood. The school</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.831" end="00:59:19.831" style="s2">can hand down whatever punishment the</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.231" end="00:59:21.331" style="s2">rules call for.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.831" end="00:59:25.131" style="s2">And I formally request that this</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.331" end="00:59:25.131" style="s2">incident be announced campus wide.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.331" end="00:59:30.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Ravena, I beg you. Tell the</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.231" end="00:59:32.631" style="s2">principal not to expel me. Please, sis.</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.931" end="00:59:34.431" style="s2">I&#39;m your own brother. Why are you</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.631" end="00:59:36.531" style="s2">pushing me over the edge? You didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.431" end="00:59:37.431" style="s2">need that question anyway. Why not give</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.531" end="00:59:39.931" style="s2">it to me?</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.431" end="00:59:41.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it to you? Do you even deserve it?</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.931" end="00:59:43.531" style="s2">Pray Sophia&#39;s safe. If she hurts her, I</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.631" end="00:59:45.331" style="s2">won&#39;t spare you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.531" end="00:59:47.531" style="s2">Principal, I need to take a leave of</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.331" end="00:59:49.131" style="s2">absence to handle something at home.</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.531" end="00:59:51.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Just submit a leave request</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.131" end="00:59:51.731" style="s2">form later.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.831" end="01:00:02.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Varelli, I need to borrow a car.</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.131" end="01:00:18.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Varelli, how very thoughtful of you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.231" end="01:00:20.931" style="s2">You even came in person just to give me</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.831" end="01:00:22.931" style="s2">the car.</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.931" end="01:00:24.231" style="s2">Get out of the car.</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.931" end="01:00:25.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not actually planning to come</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.231" end="01:00:27.031" style="s2">with me, are you?</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.031" end="01:00:27.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m heading home. Not going out to have</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.031" end="01:00:28.731" style="s2">fun.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.731" end="01:00:31.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.731" end="01:00:31.031" style="s2">Get in.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.431" end="01:00:34.131" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.631" end="01:00:35.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.131" end="01:00:36.731" style="s2">I should have asked a classmate to lend</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.531" end="01:00:38.731" style="s2">me a car.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.731" end="01:00:41.331" style="s2">After all, it isn&#39;t appropriate for you</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.731" end="01:00:42.731" style="s2">to be around me right now, Mr. Varelli.</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.331" end="01:00:44.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean it isn&#39;t appropriate</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.731" end="01:00:46.426" style="s2">right now?</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.931" end="01:00:47.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you about to get engaged?</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.426" end="01:00:50.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.931" end="01:00:52.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you hear that rumor?</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.631" end="01:00:54.631" style="s2">They did push for a business marriage</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.331" end="01:00:55.931" style="s2">with the Visconti family, but I turned</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.631" end="01:00:58.431" style="s2">it down flat.</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.931" end="01:01:01.331" style="s2">This thing never even had a start,</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.431" end="01:01:01.331" style="s2">let alone an end.</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.031" end="01:01:06.931" style="s2">Why isn&#39;t she reacting at all?</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.531" end="01:01:09.431" style="s2">Even a little surprise would be</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.931" end="01:01:09.431" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.131" end="01:01:13.731" style="s2">Miss Moretti,</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.531" end="01:01:15.432" style="s2">you&#39;re in such a rush to get back.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.731" end="01:01:17.032" style="s2">Is something wrong at home? If we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.432" end="01:01:18.532" style="s2">going to your home,</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.032" end="01:01:19.932" style="s2">I should probably stop and buy some</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.532" end="01:01:21.932" style="s2">gifts first.</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.932" end="01:01:23.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t bother buying gifts.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.932" end="01:01:26.932" style="s2">You&#39;d be better off feeding that stuff</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.332" end="01:01:26.932" style="s2">to dogs than giving it to them.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.232" end="01:01:31.732" style="s2">You don&#39;t have a good relationship with</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.632" end="01:01:35.032" style="s2">your family, do you?</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.732" end="01:01:36.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My brother stole my research for KIT.</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.032" end="01:01:39.132" style="s2">Mom locked my sister up when she found</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.932" end="01:01:39.132" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.432" end="01:01:44.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So she&#39;s the one who solved it,</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.532" end="01:01:46.832" style="s2">which means she&#39;s king.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.332" end="01:01:48.832" style="s2">Then your sister will be safe, right?</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.832" end="01:01:50.032" style="s2">How about I send a helicopter over?</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.832" end="01:01:51.432" style="s2">It&#39;ll be faster.</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.032" end="01:01:55.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.432" end="01:01:55.232" style="s2">After all, she is her daughter, too.</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.532" end="01:02:04.132" style="s2">Mr. Varelli, why stare at me like that?</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.032" end="01:02:04.132" style="s2">Did you recall something?</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.232" end="01:02:07.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone I used to know.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.332" end="01:02:09.632" style="s2">We met online.</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.957" end="01:02:13.132" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.632" end="01:02:15.232" style="s2">She ran me in absolute circles.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.132" end="01:02:16.632" style="s2">And she even sent me a huge gift at the</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.232" end="01:02:19.032" style="s2">end.</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.632" end="01:02:22.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, Mr. Varelli,</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.032" end="01:02:22.432" style="s2">what did you think of that gift?</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.132" end="01:02:30.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you know that person was me?</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.132" end="01:02:30.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have a birthmark on your right hand.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.532" end="01:02:34.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really thought I&#39;d hidden it</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.532" end="01:02:34.132" style="s2">perfectly.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.332" end="01:02:39.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hid well,</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.632" end="01:02:39.632" style="s2">but you ran into me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.432" end="01:02:46.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve completely ruined your brother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.232" end="01:02:49.232" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.632" end="01:02:51.533" style="s2">He got expelled. DO YOU HEAR ME? ARE YOU</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.232" end="01:02:53.553" style="s2">HAPPY NOW?</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.533" end="01:02:53.553" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.732" end="01:02:59.032" style="s2">Are you satisfied now?</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.832" end="01:03:00.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all your fault. You snitched to</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.032" end="01:03:01.832" style="s2">Ravenna Ona. You&#39;re not getting away</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.232" end="01:03:04.633" style="s2">with this either.</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.832" end="01:03:05.232" style="s2">Ravenna, look what you&#39;ve done to me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.633" end="01:03:06.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.232" end="01:03:09.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU LITTLE BASTARD!</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.632" end="01:03:11.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOW DARE YOU SHOW YOUR FACE HERE?</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.332" end="01:03:12.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TURNING ON HER OWN BROTHER. MY LIFE IS</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.332" end="01:03:14.432" style="s2">ALL MISERY.</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.632" end="01:03:18.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did nothing wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.432" end="01:03:19.533" style="s2">Joshua brought this all on himself.</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.132" end="01:03:22.533" style="s2">If you choose to go along with their</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.533" end="01:03:23.933" style="s2">garbage, that&#39;s who you&#39;ll end up like.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.533" end="01:03:25.733" style="s2">So you don&#39;t have to feel guilty about</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.933" end="01:03:27.733" style="s2">any of this.</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.733" end="01:03:29.233" style="s2">Let&#39;s go. Pack your things. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.733" end="01:03:31.133" style="s2">coming with me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.233" end="01:03:32.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU UNGRATEFUL LITTLE WITCH. YOU&#39;VE</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.133" end="01:03:33.933" style="s2">ALREADY ruined your brother&#39;s LIFE AND</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.633" end="01:03:36.233" style="s2">NOW YOU&#39;RE TRYING TO TAKE YOUR SISTER</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.933" end="01:03:39.533" style="s2">AWAY TOO?</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.233" end="01:03:39.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IS THERE SOMETHING I can help with?</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.333" end="01:03:47.533" style="s2">Nolan, go help Miss Moretti&#39;s sister</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.733" end="01:03:47.533" style="s2">pack her things.</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.133" end="01:03:53.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravenna, I lost my temper because you</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.333" end="01:03:55.633" style="s2">upset me. Parents always love their</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.333" end="01:03:56.433" style="s2">kids, you know?</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.633" end="01:03:58.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cut the act.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.433" end="01:04:00.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sophia, are you really leaving with her?</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.833" end="01:04:02.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you walk out that door with her,</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.033" end="01:04:04.133" style="s2">don&#39;t you ever call me mom again.</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.133" end="01:04:06.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today, either Sophia comes with me to</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.133" end="01:04:07.233" style="s2">school or you go to jail right alongside</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.533" end="01:04:08.533" style="s2">Joshua.</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.233" end="01:04:10.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU DON&#39;T HAVE THE GUTS.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.533" end="01:04:12.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I AM YOUR MOTHER.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.333" end="01:04:13.433" style="s2">IF YOU DO THIS, YOU ARE GOING TO REGRET</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.033" end="01:04:16.233" style="s2">IT FOR THE REST OF YOUR LIFE.</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.433" end="01:04:17.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RAVENNA, Joshua finally paid for it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.233" end="01:04:20.633" style="s2">We&#39;re family.</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.733" end="01:04:22.033" style="s2">How did we end up here?</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.633" end="01:04:23.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I used to think you were the only decent</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.033" end="01:04:24.833" style="s2">one in this family.</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.533" end="01:04:27.433" style="s2">Turns out you can&#39;t tell right from</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.833" end="01:04:27.433" style="s2">wrong either.</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.533" end="01:04:29.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ravenna.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.933" end="01:04:34.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s enough money on this card to pay</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.333" end="01:04:38.633" style="s2">back this family ever gave me. From now</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.633" end="01:04:38.633" style="s2">on, I&#39;m even with the Moretti family.</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.033" end="01:04:42.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.733" end="01:04:45.133" style="s2">Do you really intend to turn your back</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.433" end="01:04:45.133" style="s2">on this family?</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.159" end="01:04:49.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.433" end="01:04:50.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking Sophia to school.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.233" end="01:04:52.033" style="s2">I&#39;m warning you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.533" end="01:04:53.833" style="s2">If you ever bother her again while she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.033" end="01:04:56.433" style="s2">studying, I will never let Joshuas get</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.833" end="01:04:56.433" style="s2">away with it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.733" end="01:05:03.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you dare go after her. There&#39;s no</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.833" end="01:05:04.933" style="s2">point.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.733" end="01:05:07.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, we should check how much money is</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.933" end="01:05:07.733" style="s2">on this card right now.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.433" end="01:05:16.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she&#39;s cutting ties, so be it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.033" end="01:05:20.935" style="s2">You never belonged here in in first</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.535" end="01:05:20.935" style="s2">place.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.935" end="01:05:29.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did everything you could.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.035" end="01:05:31.635" style="s2">Some people&#39;s minds you can never</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.135" end="01:05:31.635" style="s2">change.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.335" end="01:05:36.935" style="s2">Don&#39;t beat yourself up over this, all</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.735" end="01:05:36.935" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.535" end="01:05:41.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enjoy the show, Mr. Varelli.</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.335" end="01:05:43.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just relieved you&#39;re not taking this</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.535" end="01:05:45.820" style="s2">too hard.</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.800" end="01:05:45.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.420" end="01:05:48.440" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.835" end="01:05:54.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you staring at, Mr. Varelli?</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.335" end="01:05:57.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and your sister are really close,</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.735" end="01:05:59.335" style="s2">aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.935" end="01:06:01.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister?</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.335" end="01:06:03.135" style="s2">She&#39;s got that soft, fair, innocent</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.835" end="01:06:06.235" style="s2">look.</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.135" end="01:06:07.835" style="s2">She&#39;s quiet, well-behaved, impossible</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.235" end="01:06:09.735" style="s2">not to like.</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.835" end="01:06:10.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Soft, fair skin,</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.735" end="01:06:12.735" style="s2">quiet,</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.935" end="01:06:15.035" style="s2">well-behaved.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.735" end="01:06:17.435" style="s2">I guess I only checked the quiet box</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.035" end="01:06:17.435" style="s2">then.</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.935" end="01:06:22.635" style="s2">But when I&#39;m with Ravenna, I can&#39;t seem</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.935" end="01:06:22.635" style="s2">to shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.535" end="01:06:30.435" style="s2">Nolan, take it slow and smooth.</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.435" end="01:06:31.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Having something to lean on really does</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.435" end="01:06:34.335" style="s2">feel better.</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.935" end="01:06:36.935" style="s2">Life right now doesn&#39;t feel half bad,</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.335" end="01:06:36.935" style="s2">actually.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
